    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_1056.variants.noll_simmons :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᶠ k in Filter.atTop,\n    ∃ (p : ℕ) (_ : p.Prime) (Q : Fin k → ℕ) (_ : StrictMono Q) (_ : ∀ i, Q i < p),\n    ∀ i j : Fin k, (Q i)! ≡ (Q j)! [MOD p]",
